1
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:09,093
Pasukan yang sebelumnya dikirim untuk memperkuat

2
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:11,901
Benteng Desheng, dua batalion seribu orang,

3
00:00:12,051 --> 00:00:14,141
kini sudah kehilangan separuh kekuatannya.

4
00:00:14,291 --> 00:00:18,341
Pada hari ketiga, Meng Yuanzhong tertembak panah dan gugur di medan perang.

5
00:00:18,491 --> 00:00:21,963
Hingga hari ini, pasukan Benteng Desheng yang masih bisa bertempur

6
00:00:22,113 --> 00:00:24,207
tinggal kurang dari sepertiga jumlah awal

7
00:00:25,513 --> 00:00:27,407
Panah Jenderal Zhao hampir habis

8
00:00:27,557 --> 00:00:29,821
Pohon gelondongan dan batu besar sudah habis

9
00:00:35,724 --> 00:00:39,212
Saudara-saudara, kita hidup dan mati bersama Benteng Desheng!

10
00:00:39,362 --> 00:00:40,588
Bertahan sampai mati!

11
00:00:45,162 --> 00:00:48,026
Jenderal Zhao, perintah militer Kabupaten Longgan!

12
00:00:49,596 --> 00:00:50,624
Perintah militer

13
00:00:50,774 --> 00:00:52,188
Tinggalkan Benteng Desheng

14
00:00:52,338 --> 00:00:54,938
Mundur ke garis pertahanan Punggung Duxiong Gunung Gan

15
00:00:55,088 --> 00:00:57,136
Pertahanan belakang telah selesai dibangun

16
00:00:57,286 --> 00:00:58,406
Laksanakan segera

17
00:00:58,556 --> 00:00:59,288
Jenderal

18
00:01:00,389 --> 00:01:01,195
Kita mundur

19
00:01:03,422 --> 00:01:04,544
Laksanakan perintah!

20
00:01:04,694 --> 00:01:06,112
Bawa semua korban luka

21
00:01:06,262 --> 00:01:07,492
Bawa semua senjata!

22
00:01:07,795 --> 00:01:08,417
Mundur!

23
00:01:13,762 --> 00:01:15,016
Luka-luka pergi duluan!

24
00:01:15,166 --> 00:01:16,382
Setiap tim jangan panik!

25
00:01:16,532 --> 00:01:17,184
Ikuti!

26
00:01:18,699 --> 00:01:20,579
Serbu masuk dan rebut benteng dalam!

27
00:01:27,732 --> 00:01:28,344
Kosong!

28
00:01:31,965 --> 00:01:32,677
Jenderal!

29
00:01:32,732 --> 00:01:34,016
Tidak ada orang di benteng

30
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:36,112
Pasukan Wilayah Selatan sudah mundur

31
00:01:39,733 --> 00:01:40,757
Semua waspada!

32
00:01:40,907 --> 00:01:42,153
Cek masih ada orang lain?

33
00:01:46,307 --> 00:01:47,269
Jenderal Muda

34
00:01:47,419 --> 00:01:49,763
Orang-orang Rendo Xifeng tidak mundur semalaman

35
00:01:49,913 --> 00:01:51,235
Mereka terus mengawasi

36
00:01:53,979 --> 00:01:55,161
ternyata belum pergi

37
00:01:55,246 --> 00:01:56,304
Semalam berlalu

38
00:01:56,454 --> 00:01:58,052
Pertahanan justru makin kokoh

39
00:02:11,888 --> 00:02:14,370
Di depan ada rintangan kayu dan kuda-kuda penolak

40
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,180
di belakangnya busur dan panah

41
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:18,156
lalu diikuti pasukan infanteri

42
00:02:18,306 --> 00:02:19,710
sebagai barisan terakhir

43
00:02:19,839 --> 00:02:21,951
Pertahanan Rendo Xifeng ini cukup kokoh

44
00:02:22,673 --> 00:02:24,393
Tapi pasukannya memang terbatas

45
00:02:24,543 --> 00:02:25,847
Tidak mungkin setiap titik

46
00:02:25,997 --> 00:02:27,329
dijaga seketat itu

47
00:02:27,431 --> 00:02:30,533
Di balik semak kiri, lebarnya sekitar 50 langkah

48
00:02:30,683 --> 00:02:34,473
Rintangan tanduk rusa jarang, kuda-kuda kayu juga cuma satu baris

49
00:02:34,623 --> 00:02:35,235
Huchen

50
00:02:35,656 --> 00:02:36,118
Siap!

51
00:02:36,723 --> 00:02:38,017
celah di balik semak itu,

52
00:02:38,167 --> 00:02:38,903
atau tidak?

53
00:02:39,534 --> 00:02:40,146
Terlihat

54
00:02:41,467 --> 00:02:44,153
Bawa seratus anggota pasukan khusus menyelinap ke sana

55
00:02:44,303 --> 00:02:47,159
Setelah sampai di sana, jangan terburu-buru bertindak!

56
00:02:47,309 --> 00:02:48,785
Tunggu sampai aku mengalihkan

57
00:02:48,935 --> 00:02:50,401
perhatian mereka dari depan

58
00:02:50,551 --> 00:02:52,171
Gunakan busur silang Qinghe

59
00:02:54,284 --> 00:02:56,384
Sasar para operator mesin pelontar batu

60
00:02:56,784 --> 00:02:57,650
Tembak mereka

61
00:02:58,084 --> 00:03:00,774
Satu putaran tembakan selesai, langsung mundur!

62
00:03:00,951 --> 00:03:01,633
Mengerti!

63
00:03:05,384 --> 00:03:07,590
Tunggu sampai mereka masuk ke zona tembak terbaik

64
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:08,472
Kali ini,

65
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,192
butakan mata Rendo Xifeng

66
00:03:10,973 --> 00:03:11,901
Sudah sampai

67
00:03:12,273 --> 00:03:12,985
Chongshan!

68
00:03:13,135 --> 00:03:13,597
Siap!

69
00:03:14,602 --> 00:03:16,654
Tarik 300 prajurit perisai ke depan

70
00:03:16,804 --> 00:03:18,366
Buat seolah-olah akan menyerang

71
00:03:18,516 --> 00:03:20,920
Semakin besar suaranya, semakin baik

72
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:21,492
Ingat

73
00:03:22,304 --> 00:03:24,860
Jangan sampai benar-benar menabrak rintangan mereka

74
00:03:25,010 --> 00:03:26,356
Siap, Jenderal!

75
00:03:30,143 --> 00:03:32,041
Maju, formasi perisai!

76
00:03:34,977 --> 00:03:36,409
Pemanah, maju!

77
00:03:36,559 --> 00:03:38,471
Batu pelontar, dorong keluar!

78
00:03:42,926 --> 00:03:43,776
Mereka keluar!

79
00:03:43,826 --> 00:03:45,154
Semua posisi siap tembak!

80
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:47,751
Serang!

81
00:03:58,492 --> 00:03:59,294
Bunuh semua!

82
00:04:00,026 --> 00:04:01,092
Hancurkan benteng!

83
00:04:02,126 --> 00:04:04,188
Ada panah silang, cepat sembunyi!

84
00:04:04,792 --> 00:04:06,176
Tarik kembali mesin pelontar!

85
00:04:06,326 --> 00:04:06,808
Cepat!

86
00:04:10,459 --> 00:04:11,181
Berhenti!

87
00:04:11,331 --> 00:04:11,953
Mundur!

88
00:04:15,597 --> 00:04:16,439
Tembak ke sana!

89
00:04:26,764 --> 00:04:28,932
Daya tembak garis depan belum lumpuh total,

90
00:04:29,082 --> 00:04:30,134
Tapi serangan ini

91
00:04:30,215 --> 00:04:31,465
sudah menghancurkan

92
00:04:31,615 --> 00:04:33,643
kekuatan panah dan batu lempar mereka

93
00:04:33,793 --> 00:04:35,043
yang paling diandalkan

94
00:04:35,993 --> 00:04:36,993
Dirikan tenda

95
00:04:37,143 --> 00:04:37,565
Ya

96
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:43,224
Kau punya rintangan kayu

97
00:04:43,374 --> 00:04:45,018
Aku punya busur silang Qinghe

98
00:04:45,168 --> 00:04:46,572
Kau punya mesin pelontar

99
00:04:46,722 --> 00:04:48,788
Aku akan habisi dulu operator katapultmu!

100
00:04:49,688 --> 00:04:51,044
Kalau tidak keluar hari ini,

101
00:04:51,194 --> 00:04:52,046
Lanjut besok

102
00:04:52,428 --> 00:04:53,322
Besok lagi

103
00:04:53,472 --> 00:04:55,208
Kalau begitu, lusa

104
00:04:55,358 --> 00:04:56,348
Rendo Xifeng

105
00:04:56,824 --> 00:04:58,352
Kita habisi mereka pelan-pelan

106
00:05:05,258 --> 00:05:06,330
Kalau terus menyerang,

107
00:05:06,558 --> 00:05:08,746
bisakah kita merebut Komando Militer Deshun?

108
00:05:11,158 --> 00:05:13,338
Pertempuran ini, aku kalah langkah

109
00:05:15,124 --> 00:05:16,156
Kirim Chengzhong

110
00:05:20,024 --> 00:05:21,606
Jenderal Muda ada utusan

111
00:05:23,858 --> 00:05:25,820
Jendral tua seperti Rendo Xifeng

112
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:26,982
akan mudah menyerah

113
00:05:28,703 --> 00:05:29,425
Berhenti!

114
00:05:30,736 --> 00:05:31,898
Bawa orangnya ke sini

115
00:05:32,048 --> 00:05:33,494
Geledah dan tutup matanya!

116
00:05:33,644 --> 00:05:34,106
Siap!

117
00:05:41,844 --> 00:05:43,050
Umurmu masih muda

118
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,238
tapi sudah berani

119
00:05:44,334 --> 00:05:46,058
Rendo Xifeng yang menyuruhmu datang

120
00:05:46,208 --> 00:05:47,736
Benar, Jenderal

121
00:05:47,886 --> 00:05:49,398
Apa jabatanmu di bawahnya?

122
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,698
Aku bukan bawahannya.

123
00:05:53,586 --> 00:05:55,024
Aku putra Rendo Xifeng,

124
00:05:55,386 --> 00:05:56,496
Rendo Chengzhong.

125
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,900
Ayahku menyuruhku menghubungi Jenderal.

126
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,656
Aku dan ayah ingin bergabung dengan Wilayah Selatan

127
00:06:02,806 --> 00:06:05,818
Kau bilang Rendo Xifeng ingin bergabung dengan Wilayah Selatan

128
00:06:05,968 --> 00:06:07,736
Bagaimana aku bisa percaya padamu?

129
00:06:08,834 --> 00:06:11,040
Jenderal tidak perlu langsung mempercayai saya

130
00:06:11,968 --> 00:06:13,512
Jenderal cukup asumsikan

131
00:06:13,668 --> 00:06:15,396
niat ayahku untuk menyerah itu benar

132
00:06:15,546 --> 00:06:16,968
Jika syaratnya terpenuhi

133
00:06:17,118 --> 00:06:18,440
Ayahku akan mengikuti

134
00:06:18,818 --> 00:06:21,344
permintaan Jenderal, selangkah demi selangkah

135
00:06:21,494 --> 00:06:22,748
Tak perlu percaya dulu

136
00:06:22,898 --> 00:06:24,624
Yang penting kita bahas syaratnya dulu

137
00:06:24,774 --> 00:06:26,452
Sepertinya kau sudah sangat siap

138
00:06:26,508 --> 00:06:27,000
Baik

139
00:06:27,941 --> 00:06:29,499
Kalau begitu katakan padaku,

140
00:06:29,649 --> 00:06:30,757
kenapa kalian menyerah?

141
00:06:33,049 --> 00:06:34,241
Jenderal masih muda

142
00:06:34,316 --> 00:06:37,386
tak tahu seberapa banyak yang Anda ketahui tentang Klan Rendo kami

143
00:06:37,536 --> 00:06:38,580
Silakan bicara

144
00:06:38,903 --> 00:06:41,643
Ayahku berasal dari cabang Klan Rendo di Wilayah Barat

145
00:06:41,793 --> 00:06:44,119
dan kini menjabat sebagai Komandan Pasukan

146
00:06:44,269 --> 00:06:46,657
di Komando Pengawas Militer Xishoubaotai

147
00:06:46,807 --> 00:06:48,849
Kali ini kalah bertempur melawan Jenderal,

148
00:06:48,999 --> 00:06:50,701
jika kami kembali ke Wilayah Barat,

149
00:06:50,851 --> 00:06:54,031
Keluarga kerajaan Xia Barat memang sudah curiga pada Klan Rendo.

150
00:06:54,181 --> 00:06:56,651
Tanggung jawab atas kekalahan ini akan ditimpakan

151
00:06:56,801 --> 00:06:59,607
Ayahku, aku, beserta seribu

152
00:06:59,757 --> 00:07:01,833
prajurit setia kami pasti akan dihabisi!

153
00:07:01,957 --> 00:07:03,611
Itulah alasan pertama ayahku

154
00:07:03,761 --> 00:07:05,425
ingin membelot ke Wilayah Selatan

155
00:07:05,661 --> 00:07:06,493
Lanjutkan

156
00:07:09,861 --> 00:07:12,959
Klan kami sudah lama punya preseden untuk kembali ke Wilayah Selatan

157
00:07:13,109 --> 00:07:15,767
Dahulu, tetua klan kami Rendo Yaozhen

158
00:07:15,917 --> 00:07:17,801
diam-diam menghubungi wilayah Xihe

159
00:07:17,951 --> 00:07:20,277
merencanakan penyerahan diri ke Wilayah Selatan

160
00:07:20,427 --> 00:07:23,225
Saat itu Panglima Tertinggi Hu Shenzhi mengajukan syarat

